&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;bc0b03dc3aeb&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As a Graduate Machine Learning Researcher at IMC, your work will directly impact our global trading strategies. You will apply advanced machine learning, statistical, and computational techniques to solve complex, real-world trading problems, contributing to trading strategies across global equities, futures, and options markets. Machine Learning Researchers work closely with Traders and Developers in an environment where problem solving, innovation and teamwork are recognized and rewarded.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;e2ba7aba8a46&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your Core Responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6b2ab075-1684-441d-982b-5a381642e876&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;bulletList&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;61e696ac-62c5-4121-8ab6-02ff2a5d0e7f&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;3d3da17ee8a2&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Design, implement, and evaluate machine learning models for trading applications, with successful research deployed into production&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;4f3c441a-b121-4280-a267-01b1e5e5d943&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;46cdd61d9973&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Apply rigorous statistical techniques to measure performance, control overfitting, and understand model risk and interpretability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-local-id=&quot;78102289-4b3a-423a-9857-b4c13751b0ba&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;listItem&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
